  "prefLabel": "He-W 603.03 Individual Responsibility to Report Changes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 603.03 Individual Responsibility to Report Changes. Failure to report changes no later than 10 calendar days after the change takes place, pursuant to RSA 167:17, shall result in the recoupment of any resultant overpayments or a corrective payment for any resultant underpayments.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #7182, eff 12-24-99, EXPIRED: 12-24-07\n\nNew. #9063, eff 1-5-08; ss by #11042, eff 2-24-16; ss by #14380, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES 9-20-35",
